---
import Footer from "../components/shared/Footer.astro";
import Header from "../components/shared/Header.astro";
import PageHeader from "../components/shared/PageHeader.astro";
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy | Novage"
  canonical="privacy"
  description="How novage.com.ua handles your data: cookie-free analytics, email inquiries, and what the P2P Media Loader demo shares with other viewers."
>
  <Header />
  <div id="content">
    <article>
      <PageHeader title="Privacy Policy">
        <p class="lead">Last updated: September 24, 2026</p>
      </PageHeader>
      <div class="page container content">
        <p>
          This policy explains what data novage.com.ua collects and why. The
          site is operated by Novage, LLC. For any privacy question or request,
          email <a href="mailto:contact@novage.com.ua">contact@novage.com.ua</a>
          .
        </p>

        <h2>In short</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>This site does not use cookies.</li>
          <li>
            We use cookie-free analytics that doesn't identify you personally.
          </li>
          <li>If you email us, we use your message only to reply to you.</li>
          <li>
            The P2P Media Loader demo connects your browser to other viewers,
            which shares your IP address with them — see below.
          </li>
          <li>We don't sell or share your data for advertising.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Analytics</h2>
        <p>
          We use <a href="https://umami.is/">Umami</a>, a privacy-focused
          analytics service, to count page views and see which pages and links
          are used. Umami doesn't use cookies and doesn't collect personal data.
          We see only aggregated statistics such as page views, referring
          websites, browser and device type, and country.
        </p>

        <h2>When you contact us</h2>
        <p>
          If you email us, we receive your email address, your name if you
          include it, and your message. We use them only to reply and to discuss
          the project you wrote about, and we don't add you to any mailing list.
          You can ask us to delete your messages at any time.
        </p>

        <h2>The P2P Media Loader demo</h2>
        <p>
          The <a href="/p2p-media-loader/demo">live demo</a> shows peer-to-peer
          video delivery in action, so it works differently from the rest of the
          site:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>
            <strong>Other viewers.</strong> Your browser connects directly to
            other people watching the same stream over WebRTC to exchange video
            segments. This shares your IP address with them.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Signaling servers.</strong> To find other viewers, your
            browser connects to public WebTorrent trackers (
            <code>tracker.webtorrent.dev</code> and{" "}
            <code>tracker.openwebtorrent.com</code>) and public STUN servers run
            by Google and Twilio. These services receive your IP address.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>The video stream.</strong> The demo video is served by
            Amazon Web Services, which receives standard request data such as
            your IP address.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>GitHub button.</strong> The demo page loads GitHub's star
            button, which contacts GitHub.
          </li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          These connections only happen on the demo page, and only while it is
          open.
        </p>

        <h2>Hosting</h2>
        <p>
          The site is hosted on GitHub Pages. Like any web host, GitHub
          processes technical data such as IP addresses to deliver the site and
          keep it secure. Fonts are served from our own site, not from third
          parties.
        </p>

        <h2>Your rights</h2>
        <p>
          You can ask us what data we hold about you, and ask us to correct or
          delete it, by emailing{" "}
          <a href="mailto:contact@novage.com.ua">contact@novage.com.ua</a>. If
          you are in the European Union, you also have the rights described in
          the GDPR, including the right to complain to your data protection
          authority.
        </p>

        <h2>Changes</h2>
        <p>
          If we change this policy, we will update it on this page and change
          the date at the top.
        </p>
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>
  <Footer />
</Layout>
